caches are stored. The quaternion square relation used in Proposition 4.1 is explained in the \
archimedean reduction section and in docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md.", "Text"], 
  Cell["Run this file in a fresh kernel, from top to bottom. It clears Global`.\n   Section and \
equation numbers below refer to the manuscript.\n   All arithmetic is exact. No external data files \
or packages are needed.\n   See docs/CORRESPONDENCE.md for provenance and the limits of coverage.", 
